  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material describing a vulgar sexual act",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the top text 'my favorite sex position is the jfk' which uses first-person language ('my') to create an implicit identification with the speaker of the statement. This deictic pronoun 'my' projects the user's perspective onto the textual material, making them the implied subject of the crude statement. The user is not directly addressed with 'you' or 'your', but the first-person possessive 'my' creates a semiotic projection where the viewer is positioned as the one who holds the preference described.",
